<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="day">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Team Paderborn – Agentic SE Lab</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --accent: #E4007C;
      --bg: #FFF8E7;
      --text: #1D1D1F;
      --text-secondary: #5A5A5F;
      --card-bg: #FFFFFF;
      --card-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    [data-theme="night"] {
      --bg: #14142B;
      --text: #F4F1DE;
      --text-secondary: #B8B5A7;
      --card-bg: #1F1F3D;
      --card-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      transition: background 0.3s, color 0.3s;
    }

    header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 2rem 2rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg) 0%, var(--card-bg) 100%);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--text-secondary);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .header-text h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .header-text p {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-top: 0.25rem;
    }

    #theme-toggle {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 2px solid var(--text-secondary);
      border-radius: 50%;
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    #theme-toggle:hover {
      transform: scale(1.1);
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    #theme-toggle:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid var(--accent);
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 70rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    #team .team-intro {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    #team .team-intro h2 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    #team .team-intro p {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      max-width: 40rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .card-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(16rem, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .member-card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }

    .member-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
    }

    .member-card img {
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      object-fit: cover;
      border: 3px solid var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .member-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .member-card .study {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .member-card .bio {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }

    .member-card .fun-fact {
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .hot-take {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      text-align: center;
      width: 100%;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      header {
        flex-direction: column;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
      }

      main {
        padding: 1rem;
      }

      .card-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="header-text">
      <h1>Team Paderborn</h1>
      <p>Five curious humans, one agent, and a healthy skepticism about autonomous code review (so far).</p>
    </div>
    <button id="theme-toggle" aria-label="Switch to night mode">🌙</button>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section id="team">
      <div class="team-intro">
        <h2>Meet the Crew</h2>
        <p>We're a group of M.Sc. Computer Science students at Universität Paderborn, exploring how AI reshapes the way we build software. Between lectures and pull requests, we're also aviators, chess players, astrophotographers, and one very committed FC Barcelona fan.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card-grid">
        <article class="member-card">
          <img src="{{image:ashmit.jpg}}" alt="Photo of Ashmit Goel">
          <h3>Ashmit Goel</h3>
          <p class="study">M.Sc. Computer Science, 1st semester, Universität Paderborn</p>
          <p class="bio">Ashmit is in his first semester of the M.Sc. in Computer Science at UPB. Outside of lectures, he's an aviation nerd who has spent far too long studying seat maps, a car enthusiast who will absolutely detour for a Porsche 911, and a specialty coffee obsessive who lingers on roasting forums in search of the perfect light roast. Before that, he led his state-level table tennis team as captain, so expect him to call for a "let" during standup meetings.</p>
          <p class="fun-fact">Fun fact: He was table tennis team captain at the state-level qualification tournament.</p>
          <div class="hot-take">🔥 AI could take over the world if the rate at which the progress is being currently made never plateaus.</div>
        </article>

        <article class="member-card">
          <img src="{{image:florian.jpg}}" alt="Photo of Florian Menzel">
          <h3>Florian Menzel</h3>
          <p class="study">M.Sc. Computer Science, 7th semester, Universität Paderborn</p>
          <p class="bio">Florian is deep into his 7th semester of the M.Sc. in Computer Science, with a strong focus on software architecture and open-source contributions. He believes the best debugging technique involves stepping away, making a cup of coffee, and letting the bug announce itself upon his return. As one of the more senior members of the group, he's the one who'll remind you to read the spec before you prompt the LLM.</p>
          <p class="fun-fact">Fun fact: His go-to debugging technique is taking a break and letting the bug reveal itself when he comes back.</p>
          <div class="hot-take">🔥 Developers who can only work with AI will struggle more than developers who barely use it.</div>
        </article>

        <article class="member-card">
          <img src="{{image:narayan.jpg}}" alt="Photo of Narayan Singh Bhadauriya">
          <h3>Narayan Singh Bhadauriya</h3>
          <p class="study">M.Sc. Computer Science, UPB · B.Tech, RGPV University</p>
          <p class="bio">Narayan holds a B.Tech in Computer Science from RGPV University and is now pursuing his M.Sc. at UPB. When he's not staring at a monitor, you'll find him deep into a chess game (he's rated in the top 1% of players), binge-watching anime, or getting lost in a manga arc. He's also the team member most likely to raise the question of AI's water and energy consumption in the middle of a deployment discussion.</p>
          <p class="fun-fact">Fun fact: He is rated among the top 1% of chess players worldwide.</p>
          <div class="hot-take">🔥 AI will lead to a disruption of traditional white collared jobs in Tech and Finance.</div>
        </article>

        <article class="member-card">
          <img src="{{image:ronit.jpg}}" alt="Photo of Ronit Gupta">
          <h3>Ronit Gupta</h3>
          <p class="study">M.Sc. Computer Science, UPB · B.Tech, LNIIT Jaipur</p>
          <p class="bio">Ronit completed his B.Tech at LNM Institute of Information Technology in Jaipur in 2025 and is now an M.Sc. student at UPB. He's a self-described die-hard FC Barcelona fan of over a decade, an avid traveller who collects foreign currency dating back to the 1800s, and a regular at the gym where he also plays cricket. Expect deep conversations about cinema the moment the group chat goes quiet.</p>
          <p class="fun-fact">Fun fact: He collects foreign currency from around the world, including pieces from the 1800s and 1900s.</p>
          <div class="hot-take">🔥 Like the dot-com bubble, the AI bubble will burst and valuations will crash, then stabilize, followed by gradual progress.</div>
        </article>

        <article class="member-card">
          <img src="{{image:vaibhav.jpg}}" alt="Photo of Vaibhav Deshpande">
          <h3>Vaibhav Deshpande</h3>
          <p class="study">M.Sc. Computer Science, UPB · B.Tech, Pune Vidyarthi Gruha</p>
          <p class="bio">Vaibhav earned his B.Tech from Pune Vidyarthi Gruha's College of Engineering and is now in the M.Sc. program at UPB. His interests orbit the cosmos and the puzzle box: astrophotography, astronomy, Rubik's cubes, and long playlists. He's also the person who once pointed a camera at the Subaru Telescope in Hawaii to capture deep-sky objects. He firmly believes an engineer's value lies in thinking, not typing.</p>
          <p class="fun-fact">Fun fact: He has photographed various deep-sky objects using the Subaru Telescope in Hawaii.</p>
          <div class="hot-take">🔥 AI won't eliminate the need for software engineers; it will expose the difference between those who can think and those who can only code.</div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    const toggle = document.getElementById('theme-toggle');
    const html = document.documentElement;
    const STORAGE_KEY = 'upb-agentic-se-theme';

    function applyTheme(theme) {
      html.setAttribute('data-theme', theme);
      if (theme === 'day') {
        toggle.textContent = '🌙';
        toggle.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Switch to night mode');
      } else {
        toggle.textContent = '☀️';
        toggle.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Switch to day mode');
      }
    }

    const saved = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY);
    applyTheme(saved || 'day');

    toggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const next = html.getAttribute('data-theme') === 'day' ? 'night' : 'day';
      applyTheme(next);
      localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, next);
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
